## Phase 4: Configure Vector Data Routing (Proxmox Host)

Replace `/etc/vector/vector.yaml` to parse your selected Docker logs and route them to Logdy:

```yaml
sources:
  docker_nested_logs:
    type: "docker_logs"
    docker_host: "unix:///run/docker-nested-101.sock" # Static path maintained by update-lxc-docker-sock.sh
    include_containers:
      - "stremio-einthusan"
      - "stremio-einthusan-pg"
      - "authelia"
      - "easynews-plus-plus"
      - "stremio-recommends"
      - "stremio-reddit-recommends-onnx"
      - "bitmagnet"
      - "postgres"

sinks:
  logdy_central:
    type: "socket"
    inputs: ["docker_nested_logs"]
    address: "192.168.1.40:8123" # Replace with your Central Logdy LXC IP
    mode: "tcp"
    encoding:
      codec: "json" # Keeps structured data for UI parsing
```

